---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const cat = 'Jobs';
---

<BaseLayout title="Remote Marketing Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home Marketing Career | RemoteWorkHub" description="Complete guide to remote marketing jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote marketers, salary ranges by specialization from $42K-$180K+, essential skills, certifications, tools, and how to break into digital marketing with no experience. Includes content marketing, SEO, paid media, social media, email, analytics, and growth marketing career paths.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-medium mb-2">{cat}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Remote Marketing Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home Marketing Career | RemoteWorkHub</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">jobs</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">marketing</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">career</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">entry-level</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">digital-marketing</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Complete guide to remote marketing jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote marketers, salary ranges by specialization from $42K-$180K+, essential skills, certifications, tools, and how to break into digital marketing with no experience. Includes content marketing, SEO, paid media, social media, email, analytics, and growth marketing career paths.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
